{"annotations":[{"sid":"58","system":"root","text":"POWER PLANT"},{"sid":"67","system":"root","text":"READING THIS COPY\nName = symbol: description\nUnder a name: its formula, or values\nread live from its parameters\nParameters: study/param_study.m\n\nLINE COLOUR = THE SIGNAL\nblue: pressure p (bar)\norange: flow f (kg/s)\npurple: valve setting z (0 to 1)\nred: fuel feed u (kg/s)\ngrey: logging only\n\nFILL = THE BLOCK'S JOB\nblue or orange: a state of the plant\ngreen: input you set\nlilac: controller\nyellow: limit (saturation)"},{"sid":"68","system":"root","text":"EQUATIONS (6) $\\frac{dp_{bp}}{dt} = k_4\\,(f_t + f_{out} - f_c - f_{in})$ (12) $z_2 = k_{in}\\,(p_{bp} - p_{bp0})$ (13) $z_3 = k_{out}\\,(p_{bp0} - p_{bp})/p_a$ (1) to (5) are in Upper section, (7) to (9) in Steam accumulator."},{"sid":"69","system":"root","text":"Each logging block keeps only the\nlast 2000 samples (MaxDataPoints)."},{"sid":"64","system":"4","text":"UPPER SECTION"},{"sid":"70","system":"4","text":"EQUATIONS (1) $T_1 \\frac{df_p}{dt} + f_p = k_0 u$ (2) $\\frac{dp_b}{dt} = \\frac{f_p - f_b}{T_s}$ (3) $f_b = k_1 \\sqrt{p_b^2 - p_{hp}^2}$ (4) $\\frac{dp_{hp}}{dt} = k_2\\,(f_b - f_t)$ (5) $f_t = k_3 z_1 p_{hp}$ Each State-Space block holds one state: $\\dot x = Ax + Bu$ and $y = x$. With $A = 0$ it is a plain integrator ($p_b$ and $p_{hp}$)."},{"sid":"43","system":"27","text":"STEAM ACCUMULATOR"},{"sid":"71","system":"27","text":"EQUATIONS (7) $f_{in} = k_5 z_2 \\sqrt{p_{cp}^2 - p_a^2}$ (8) $f_{out} = k_6 z_3 p_a$ (9) $\\frac{dp_a}{dt} = (h_1 p_a + h_2)\\,\\frac{f_{in} - f_{out}}{m_a}$ Both limits are [0, 0], so $z_2 = z_3 = 0$: the accumulator is off in plant.slx."}],"blocks":[{"kind":"SubSystem","name":"Upper section","params":[{"label":null,"name":"RequestExecContextInheritance","value":"off"},{"label":null,"name":"AttributesFormatString","value":"eqs. (1) to (5)"}],"sid":"4","system":"root","type":"SubSystem"},{"kind":"Inport","name":"u: fuel feed","params":[],"sid":"5","system":"4","